  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.08 Designated email address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.08 “Designated email address” means the email address provided by an applicant or licensee as the address for the OPLC to use when sending notifications and licenses.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1502.07) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
